  "details": "I think a amazing feature for worlds, Especially now that portals ui is getting redone, Would be the ability to \"Theme\" portals with Udon or change them entirely.\n\nImagine making a medieval world, and being able to when someone drops a portal instead of the normal VRC one being placed down, it drops a Gate themed with the world, Obvs still with portal info and such.\n\nOr in a minecraft world, A neather Portal is dropped.\n\nOr in a Sci-Fi World, You could drop a custom teleporter as the portal marker.\n\nI think the ability to adjust portals within reason could be cool (obvs would have to still have the UI above whatever themed portal so people know its a portal)\n\nBut being able to swap the look of the portal would be really nice for world creators.",
